# Custom local horizon: "azimuth_deg  altitude_deg" pairs (NINA format).
# Default = a flat, unobstructed horizon (altitude 0 all around). Replace these
# values with your own obstruction profile (buildings, trees, hills) if you
# want the predictor to ignore transits blocked by your local skyline.
000.0    0.0
045.0    0.0
090.0    0.0
135.0    0.0
180.0    0.0
225.0    0.0
270.0    0.0
315.0    0.0
